@startuml
title LightRAG Enrich Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #3d4a57
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4c5b6b
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f7fbff
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4c5b6b
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #eef5fb
skinparam DefaultFontName Menlo

|Entry|
start
:Entry State
- receive retry-worthy primary attempt
- keep best_attempt = primary_attempt
- collect primary cache keys;

|Split Retry|
:Split Retry Phase
- if token_count exceeds threshold
	split chunk by token size
- run phase=retry_split per subchunk
- collect parsed retry outputs
- merge outputs and build split_aggregate_attempt
- promote if better than best_attempt;

|Enrichment|
:Enrichment Phase
- if best_attempt is still retry-worthy
	run phase=enrichment
- pass draft_output from best_attempt
- may enable extract tools + CoT
- tool handlers: current_document_query,
	search_extracted_entities, grep
- append enrichment cache keys
- promote if enrichment_attempt is better;

|Result|
:Return Best Attempt
- maybe_nodes + maybe_edges
- tags + cache keys;
stop
@enduml